  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Devil In A Sleeping Bag**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [5]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Reverend [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2019-05-25** (recommended): audience recording; 14 songs; 107 min; rated 4.5/5 by 2 [1]\n- **billystrings2019-05-25.16-44**: source not stated; 0 songs; 116 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer first saw the band at Dark Star Jubilee, saying it exposed many hardcore Deadheads to the band [4]\n- Show was part of Dark Star Jubilee, May 24-26, 2019, headlined by Dark Star Orchestra, Chris Robinson Brotherhood and Marcus King Band [6]\n- Two covers were played for the first time: one a Greensky Bluegrass song, the other a Willie Nelson song [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2019-05-25**: taped by Garran Petrie; transferred by Garran Petrie; source: Aud [1]. Also: Recorded with a Zoom F8 in 24-bit/48k WAV, then mixed in Studio One [1]\n- **billystrings2019-05-25.16-44**: taped by mott77; transferred by mott77; source: Microtech Gefell M210 + AKG C451b's > Sound Devices MixPre 10T (24-48) [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Legend Valley - Thornville, OH - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/show/legend-valley-thornville-oh-2/) [7]",
